name: Terminate Processing
type: Coordination/Sequential Workflow Step
description: >
  Requests graceful termination of the current processing scope after all
  preceding workflow changes and emitted events have been applied. The
  Coordination runtime implements this step through the processor's buffered
  graceful-termination effect. At the root scope, the processor writes the
  standard Processing Terminated Marker and ends the processing run.

reason:
  type: Text
  description: Optional reason stored in the processor termination marker and lifecycle event.
